WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.301
-You guys, Mother's Day
is coming up

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:03.302
and we wanted
to do something special

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:04.637
in honor of that, so,

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.272
we teamed up with Samsung

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:09.075
to celebrate five Supermoms
this week.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:12.144
So we asked people to nominate
an epic mom in their life,

00:00:12.144 --> 00:00:14.581
an amazing person who's gone
above and beyond this past year,

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.716
whether it's juggling jobs
or volunteering

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.084
or working on the front lines,

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.486
or anything else,
all while being a mom,

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:22.588
which is just a hard job
in itself.

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:24.990
We set up video interviews
with the moms.

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.626
We told them it was
for NBC's Instagram.

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:29.963
But what we didn't tell them is
that I was going to call them

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:34.400
-Ooh.
-on my new Samsung Galaxy S21
Ultra 5G phone

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.068
and surprise them with something

00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:39.238
to make their Mother's Day
a little brighter, yeah.

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:43.309
Our first mom is Ashley Tuvalu
from Mesa, Arizona.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:45.645
She was nominated
by her mother, Cara.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:46.712
Check it out.

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:48.080
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.817
-♪ Tonight Show ♪

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.253
♪ Supermom Surprise ♪

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:54.554
-Hi.
My name is Cara

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.623
and my daughter Ashley
is a Supermom.

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:58.691
She is so patient.

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.893
She's got the three little boys
all under five,

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.094
which is a handful.

00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:03.729
At the beginning
of the pandemic,

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:06.199
Ashley, unfortunately,
was laid off from her job

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:09.402
and picked up another job,
working online from home.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.537
They had been saving
for a house.

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:14.907
Had to put that on hold as well,
so we're all under one roof.

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:17.310
She is so in tune
with each of them

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.579
and each of their
individual needs

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:22.882
and keeping them safe, keeping
them happy, making them smart,

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:25.151
and putting good people back
in the world.

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.586
[ Chime ]
-Ashley?

00:01:27.653 --> 00:01:29.622
Ashley?
-Yes.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.256
-Are you -- Oh.

00:01:31.256 --> 00:01:32.658
I'm sorry. Let me turn

00:01:32.658 --> 00:01:34.326
my video camera on.
I'm sorry.

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:36.128
-OMG, that's Jimmy.

00:01:36.128 --> 00:01:37.630
[ Laughter ]
-Ashley, hi.

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.098
[ Cheering and applause ]
It's Jimmy Fallon.

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:40.699
-Aah!
-We wanted to thank you

00:01:40.699 --> 00:01:42.034
for being a Supermom, and also,

00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:44.971
our friends at Samsung wanted
to thank you as well,

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:48.274
so we'd like to give you
a Samsung Galaxy package.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.043
-Aah!
-I mean, this is everything.

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:52.144
You've got the watch.
You get the tablet.

00:01:52.144 --> 00:01:53.846
-What?!
-You got the ear buds.

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.114
-What?!
-All of that.

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:56.849
-Thank you for being
such a Supermom.

00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:57.917
-Thanks, Jimmy!

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.652
Jimmy said my name.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.454
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, Ashley,
we have one more thing

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:03.890
that Samsung would like
to give you as well.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:06.992
We'd like to give you
a check for $25,000.

00:02:06.992 --> 00:02:09.963
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Holy schnikeys!

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:12.131
-Holy schnikeys. [ Laughs ]

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:13.199
-You're on your way
to the house.

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:15.301
-[ Muffled ] Aaaaah!
-Oh, thank you!

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.970
-Your mom loves you
and we all love you.

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:19.639
Happy early Mother's Day.

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:21.273
-We love you, Jimmy!
-Thank you.

00:02:21.273 --> 00:02:22.641
-Holy cow!

00:02:22.641 --> 00:02:23.977
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Come on!

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:25.744
-Amazing.
-That's great.

00:02:25.744 --> 00:02:28.381
-Thank you to Ashley and Cara,
Samsung,

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:29.782
and all the Supermoms
out there.

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:31.918
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

